#: routes/main.py:47
msgid "Lake Balkhash"
msgstr "Lago Baljash"

#: routes/main.py:48
msgid ""
"One of the largest lakes in Asia, located in southeastern Kazakhstan. "
"Uniquely, its western part is fresh water while the eastern part is saline."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los lagos más grandes de Asia, ubicado en el sureste de Kazajstán. "
"Curiosamente, su parte occidental es de agua dulce mientras que la parte "
"oriental es salada."

#: routes/main.py:57
msgid "Caspian Sea"
msgstr "Mar Caspio"

#: routes/main.py:58
msgid ""
"The world's largest inland body of water, often described as the world's "
"largest lake or a full-fledged sea. It lies between Europe and Asia."
msgstr ""
"La masa de agua interior más grande del mundo, a menudo descrita como el "
"lago más grande del mundo o un mar en toda regla. Se encuentra entre Europa "
"y Asia."

#: routes/main.py:67
msgid "Lake Catemaco"
msgstr "Lago Catemaco"

#: routes/main.py:68
msgid ""
"A freshwater lake located in south-central Veracruz, Mexico, formed by "
"natural damming of volcanic origin."
msgstr ""
"Lago de agua dulce ubicado en el centro-sur de Veracruz, México, formado por"
" represas naturales de origen volcánico."

#: routes/main.py:77
msgid "Lake Huron"
msgstr "Lago Hurón"

#: routes/main.py:78
msgid ""
"One of the five Great Lakes of North America, connecting to Lake Michigan by"
" the Straits of Mackinac."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco Grandes Lagos de América del Norte, que se conecta con el "
"lago Michigan por el estrecho de Mackinac."

#: routes/main.py:87
msgid "Lake Malawi"
msgstr "Lago Malaui"

#: routes/main.py:88
msgid ""
"An African Great Lake and the southernmost lake in the East African Rift "
"system, located between Malawi, Mozambique and Tanzania."
msgstr ""
"Un Gran Lago africano y el lago más al sur del sistema del Rift de África "
"Oriental, ubicado entre Malawi, Mozambique y Tanzania."

#: routes/main.py:97
msgid "Lake Pátzcuaro"
msgstr "Lago de Pátzcuaro"

#: routes/main.py:98
msgid ""
"A lake in Michoacán, Mexico, famous for its cultural significance, islands, "
"and traditional fishing."
msgstr ""
"Un lago en Michoacán, México, famoso por su importancia cultural, sus islas "
"y su pesca tradicional."

#: routes/main.py:107
msgid "Lake Poopó"
msgstr "Lago Poopó"

#: routes/main.py:108
msgid ""
"A large saline lake in a shallow depression in the Altiplano Mountains in "
"Bolivia, known for its fluctuating water levels."
msgstr ""
"Un gran lago salino en una depresión poco profunda en las montañas del "
"Altiplano en Bolivia, conocido por sus niveles fluctuantes de agua."

#: routes/main.py:117
msgid "Santa María del Oro"
msgstr "Santa María del Oro"

#: routes/main.py:118
msgid ""
"A crater lake located in the crater of a volcano in the state of Nayarit, "
"Mexico."
msgstr ""
"Un lago de cráter ubicado en el cráter de un volcán en el estado de Nayarit,"
" México."

#: routes/main.py:127
msgid "Lake Titicaca"
msgstr "Lago Titicaca"

#: routes/main.py:128
msgid ""
"A large, deep, freshwater lake in the Andes on the border of Bolivia and "
"Peru, often called the highest navigable lake in the world."
msgstr ""
"Un lago grande, profundo y de agua dulce en los Andes, en la frontera de "
"Bolivia y Perú, a menudo llamado el lago navegable más alto del mundo."

#: routes/main.py:137
msgid "Lake Yuriria"
msgstr "Lago Yuriria"

#: routes/main.py:138
msgid ""
"A man-made lake in Guanajuato, Mexico, constructed in the 16th century, "
"representing the first hydraulic work of the colonial period in America."
msgstr ""
"Un lago artificial en Guanajuato, México, construido en el siglo XVI, "
"representando la primera obra hidráulica del período colonial en América."

#: routes/main.py:147
msgid "Lake Zirahuén"
msgstr "Lago Zirahuén"

#: routes/main.py:148
msgid ""
"A deep, endorheic basin lake in Michoacán, Mexico, known for its clear blue "
"waters."
msgstr ""
"Un lago profundo de cuenca endorreica en Michoacán, México, conocido por sus"
" claras aguas azules."

